      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Assalamu Alaikum | السلام عليكم\nVrChat We do not see your support for both languages, Arabic and Farsi,\nIt should be noted that there are societies for both languages and some of the members do not know English but are passionate about the game.\nㅤ\nArabic and Farsi Letters orders.\nIt's like reading \"Hello\" as \"olleH\". السلام is displayed as: م ا ل س ل ا\nArabic and Farsi Letters connectivity.\nAs seen here: “السلام is displayed as: م ا ل س ل ا” \nthe letters are not disconnected.\nㅤ\nThere is a suggestion to use:\nUPersian\n\"Allows you to write and read the correct way of letters for both languages\"\nhttps://github.com/ElectroGryphon/EGGA/tree/master/UPersian\nㅤ\nIf you require assistance with translating menus or texts, there are many people who are willing to help.",
